# W16 ENGINE

## Master System Architecture & Protocol Specification

### ARTIFIELD Core Intelligence, Orchestration & Reliability Layer

---

# 0. CORE PURPOSE

W16 is the central orchestration and intelligence-control layer of ARTIFIELD.

W16 is NOT:

* a chatbot
* an AI model
* Vex
* a database
* a UI
* a single provider integration
* a replacement for deterministic software logic

W16 IS:

> The control plane that determines how ARTIFIELD receives, validates, stores, retrieves, calculates, analyzes, routes, caches, protects, versions, and delivers project information.

Primary principle:

```text
AI is replaceable.
W16 rules are authoritative.
ARTIFIELD data is the source of truth.
Deterministic computation outranks AI computation.
Validated data outranks unvalidated data.
Approved knowledge outranks model assumptions.
```

