# 3.# W16 GATEWAY CORE

## Production Implementation v1.0

### File

```text
W16_Gateway.gs
```

### Purpose

The W16 Gateway is the single controlled entry point for requests entering the W16 Engine.

It is responsible for:

```text
RECEIVE
↓
NORMALIZE
↓
VALIDATE
↓
IDENTIFY
↓
AUTHORIZE
↓
CONTEXTUALIZE
↓
LIMIT
↓
ROUTE
```

No downstream W16 module should directly trust raw frontend parameters.

